Following (cite: Carilli13), we calculated the CO(1-0) luminosity using $$\begin{eqnarray}
L'_{\rm CO}=3.25\times10^{7}~(\dfrac{S_{\rm CO}}{\rm Jy~km s^{-1}})~(\dfrac{\nu_{\rm obs}}{\rm GHz})^{-2}~(\dfrac{D_{\rm L}}{\rm Mpc})^{2}~(1+z)^{-3}
,
\end{eqnarray}$$

The mass outflow rate can then be calculated from the relation: $$\begin{equation}
    \dot{M}_\mathrm{out} \approx C  \frac{M_\mathrm{out}V_\mathrm{out}}{r_\mathrm{out}}.
    \label{eq:outflow_mass_rate}
\end{equation}$$
